flowchart TD
    Start([Install]) --> Lock[Acquire]
    Lock --> Recover[Recover shared journal]
    Recover --> Refresh[RefreshInstalled]
    Refresh --> ExplicitPlugin{显式规范 Plugin ref 且所选 Agent manifest 全部精确命中?}
    ExplicitPlugin -->|yes| ManifestHit[每个所选 Agent unchanged] --> Release
    ExplicitPlugin -->|no| List[Cloud List + resolve exact PowerRef]
    List --> Agent{next Agent}
    Agent --> Type{Power type}
    Type -->|Skill| SkillResolve[ResolveSkill + Config Find]
    SkillResolve --> SkillSame{same manifest version?}
    SkillSame -->|yes| Unchanged[unchanged]
    SkillSame -->|no| Cache[Cache PrepareSkill；hit 复验，miss 时私有目标 DownloadSkill 后原子发布 cache/staging]
    Cache --> FSTx[filesystem Install transaction]
    FSTx --> FSJournal[schema v1 driver=filesystem]

    Type -->|Agent| AgentResolve[ResolveAgent + Config Find]
    AgentResolve --> AgentSame{same manifest version?}
    AgentSame -->|yes| Unchanged
    AgentSame -->|no| AgentCache[Cache PrepareAgent；hit 复验，miss 时私有 agent.yaml DownloadAgent 后原子发布 cache/staging]
    AgentCache --> AgentTx[filesystem InstallAgent transaction]
    AgentTx --> FSJournal

    Type -->|MCP| MCPResolve[ResolveMCP + Config Find]
    MCPResolve --> MCPInspect[Agent CLI Inspect]
    MCPInspect --> MCPState{manifest / presence / version}
    MCPState -->|same + present| Unchanged
    MCPState -->|no manifest + present| Fail[unmanaged conflict]
    MCPState -->|manifest + absent| MCPStale[InstallMCP nil definitions]
    MCPState -->|first absent| NewDef[Cloud GetMCP new]
    MCPState -->|update present| OldDef[Cloud GetMCP old] --> NewDef
    NewDef --> MCPTx[agent-cli InstallMCP transaction]
    MCPStale --> MCPTx
    MCPTx --> MCPJournal[schema v1 driver=agent-cli]
    MCPJournal --> Phases[removing-old / adding-new / committing / rolling-back]

    Type -->|Plugin| PluginManifest[Config Find target exact version]
    PluginManifest -->|same version| Unchanged
    PluginManifest -->|missing or different| PluginResolve[derive logical target + ResolvePlugin]
    PluginResolve --> PluginMode{DeploymentMode}

    PluginMode -->|marketplace| MarketplaceEnsure[Ensure target artifact；miss 才下载 canonical package，先生成原生 manifest，再由它们生成双 marketplace]
    MarketplaceEnsure --> MarketplaceTarget[validate artifact + marketplace adapter + MarketplaceFor target]
    MarketplaceTarget --> MarketplaceManifest{previous manifest?}
    MarketplaceManifest -->|no| MarketplaceTargetFacts[Inspect target marketplace，再 Inspect target Plugin]
    MarketplaceManifest -->|yes| MarketplacePreviousFacts[Inspect previous marketplace，再 Inspect previous Plugin]
    MarketplacePreviousFacts -->|both absent| MarketplaceStale[Remove stale manifest] --> MarketplaceTargetFacts
    MarketplacePreviousFacts -->|partial| PluginFail[fail closed；保留 manifest/artifact]
    MarketplacePreviousFacts -->|both present| PreviousLookup[Lookup previous only now；validate artifact/MarketplaceFor/source/selector]
    PreviousLookup --> MarketplaceSwitch[切换 remove old Plugin → unregister old source → register new source → add Plugin → manifest]
    MarketplaceTargetFacts -->|marketplace absent + Plugin absent| MarketplaceFirst[首装 register source → add Plugin → manifest]
    MarketplaceTargetFacts -->|exact retained source + Plugin absent| MarketplaceReinstall[重装 reuse source → add Plugin → manifest]
    MarketplaceTargetFacts -->|other| PluginFail
    MarketplaceReinstall -. commit / rollback / recovery .-> RetainedRecovery[不 unregister/register；仅方向已固定为 rolling-back 且 source 缺失时离线恢复]

    PluginMode -->|filesystem| FilesystemManifest{previous manifest?}
    FilesystemManifest -->|yes| FilesystemPreviousFact[Inspect previous logical Plugin]
    FilesystemPreviousFact -->|exact present| FilesystemEnsure
    FilesystemPreviousFact -->|absent| FilesystemAbsent[TargetPath + validate physical absence + Remove stale manifest] --> FilesystemTargetFact
    FilesystemPreviousFact -->|other| PluginFail
    FilesystemManifest -->|no| FilesystemTargetFact[Inspect target logical Plugin]
    FilesystemTargetFact -->|exact absent| FilesystemEnsure[Ensure target artifact after facts]
    FilesystemTargetFact -->|present or other| PluginFail
    FilesystemEnsure --> FilesystemStage[validate artifact + StageFilesystem] --> FilesystemPluginTx[InstallPlugin filesystem transaction；Hermes CLI 激活，Bibit 无 Plugin CLI]
    MarketplaceFirst --> PluginJournal[schema v1 driver=plugin；每次 Agent 写操作前持久 phase]
    MarketplaceReinstall --> PluginJournal
    MarketplaceSwitch --> PluginJournal
    FilesystemPluginTx --> PluginJournal

    FSJournal --> Outcome[installed/upgraded/downgraded]
    Phases --> Outcome
    PluginJournal --> Outcome
    Unchanged --> Agent
    Outcome --> Agent
    Fail --> Batch[fail-fast + remaining unexecuted]
    PluginFail --> Batch
    Agent -->|done| Release[Release then render]
    Batch --> Release
